{
 "points": [
  {
   "id": "P1.1",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "LQD(F+N) below DNS/ME; robotics gain over GA not significant; SOTA claim unsupported",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.2",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Robotics lacks QD score and coverage; novelty only relative to ME",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.3",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Comparing fitness-trained learner to QD methods on max fitness is a mismatch",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.4",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No CMA-ES, Sep-CMA-ES or tuned diversity-preserving GA baseline",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.5",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Higher novelty than truncation GA expected; no control isolating diversity as causal",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.6",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Novelty evaluated with same descriptor space and metric used for LQD(N) training",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.7",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Claim that partial archives inflate ME novelty is asserted without quantification",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.8",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No mechanistic characterization, input ablation or comparison with DNS rule",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.9",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Dimension and population generalization shown on two functions without variance",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.10",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "'Far outside training' overstated; OOD functions similar synthetic landscapes",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.11",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Training descriptors are random linear projections of genotype",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.12",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Need table-level robotics results with CIs and more tasks",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.13",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Massive meta-training compute and O(N^2) inner-loop attention cost not compared",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.14",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "GA tuning and reproduction operator unspecified in main text",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.15",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Baseline hyperparameters not described or tuned with comparable budget",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.16",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "LQD benefits from held-out model selection unavailable to baselines",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.17",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Mixed medians/means, log normalization distorts differences",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.18",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Robotics aggregate p-value and normalization poorly detailed; few tasks drive it",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.19",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Recipe and architecture inherited from Lange et al.; modest methodological novelty",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.20",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No ablation against existing learned-GA architecture",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.21",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "'Can represent any QD algorithm' false given fixed truncation and features",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.1",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Recent MetaBBO and QD works omitted from review and comparison",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.2",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Learning selection via transformer exists (Lange et al., GLHF); novelty undiscussed",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.3",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Controlling only selection pressure is too inflexible to discover new algorithms",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.4",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "If LQD(Q) keeps diversity, why worse than LQD(QD); training may be inadequate",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.5",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "No comparison with existing fitness-based MetaBBO approaches",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.6",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Why robot control needs QD is unexplained",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.7",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Descriptor dimension D unspecified; distance-preservation claim unproven",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.8",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Reproduction size B not defined",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.9",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "8 H100s for results only competitive with GA and MAP-Elites",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.1",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "Some method elements and results unclear",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.2",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "A few claims are unsupported",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.3",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "Some figures have issues",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.4",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "Relevant variants and ablations missing",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.5",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "Should compare with descriptor-learning approaches like AURORA",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.1",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "QD viewed only as GA-based; no PGA-ME, PPGA, BOP-Elites or CMA-MAE baselines",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.2",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "Should discuss or show how LQD integrates with methods like CMA-MAE",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.1",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Ablation limited; transformer architecture and size impact unexplored",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.2",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Table 4 lacks p-values or variance",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.3",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "No analysis of performance scaling with problem dimension",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.4",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "No comparison with state-of-the-art BBO such as CMA-ES",
   "minor": false
  }
